  "method": [
    "Use source-bound cost geometry and subtract0.5 to express Canvas coordinates at pixel centers. Never refit the scan matrix to a mana candidate.",
    "Known source paper colors identify paper-distance fields. Native-only paper arcs exclude glyphs and unavailable perimeter. Per-ray contrast is normalized and softly saturated so a stronger ink/shadow edge cannot dominate.",
    "The source must recover its own known circle within0.75 px before its scan comparison can contribute. All 567 source circles pass; observed coordinate/radius error bounds are disclosed above.",
    "Boundary-limited scans and foil-only observations remain explicit. Shared normal-frame fitting uses one median/MAD diameter-outlier policy across colors, with all rejected IDs retained.",
    "The shared proposal uses451 geometry observations and 219 adjacent-symbol pitch pairs. It is unrounded and unadopted; native full-card replay and glyph/shadow/color checks are still required.",
    "Earlier signed/unsaturated detectors are retained as rejected diagnostics. Their large black/generic errors must not be promoted into renderer adjustments."
  ],
